  "details": "- CVE-2026-13732: Fix out-of-bounds write in the STABS parser's\n  read_member_functions(); the destructor/non-destructor split mis-updated the\n  linked-list predecessor pointer, so destructors stayed in the list while the\n  length counter was decremented, causing a negative-index write past the start\n  of the member-function array when a crafted ELF with .stab/.stabstr sections\n  was loaded.",
